[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0021","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11165","title":"Thermo Fisher Scientific dataTaker DT80 dEX 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Thermo Fisher Scientific dataTaker DT80 dEX 1.50.012 版本存在信息泄露漏洞，由于 /services/getFile.cmd 接口未对 userfile 参数进行路径遍历校验，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接请求 /services/getFile.cmd?userfile=config.xml 路径，直接读取设备配置文件 config.xml，从而获取敏感凭证及配置信息。该漏洞影响 dataTaker DT80 dEX 1.50.012 版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、无需用户交互，攻击者可远程无认证直接访问敏感配置文件导致凭证泄露及设备配置泄露，进而可能导致设备完全被控制。攻击者只需发送构造的 HTTP GET 请求即可利用，无需任何前置条件。建议升级至修复版本或限制相关接口访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11165"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-12T12:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:01:20Z","remediation":"立即在设备上部署最新的固件版本（X.X.X或更高），这修正了配置文件访问的认证漏洞。为Web管理界面启用强认证并限制来源IP，防止未授权访问。如果无法立即应用固件更新，可临时禁用`/services/`目录或通过防火墙阻止对该URI的外部访问。实施网络分段以隔离设备，将其与企业网络分离。定期审计配置文件访问日志，发现任何异常访问后立即调查。关闭设备不必要的服务，减少攻击面。所有默认凭据必须立即更改为强密码，并启用多因素认证保护管理界面访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/143328/DataTaker-DT80-dEX-1.50.012-Sensitive-Configuration-Exposure.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42313/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42313","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11165.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-11165.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11165.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11165.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-11165.rules","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-11165_3.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-11165.json","https://github.com/liqzz/vultrap/blob/10d370464af2a0b2f4966e5a301f3db88b43ca26/rules/nuclei/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11165.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-11165_1.yaml","https://github.com/Hepburnsunsir/poc-/blob/3303182f1e0caa3228cb2b3ce8cd9147b237c5b7/exp/poc/exploit-db-42313.txt","https://github.com/jivy26/infiltra/blob/ecdaa0908adf81aec0199fec3179af7351e2ede0/infiltra/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11165.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1206","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-8570","title":"Microsoft Office 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 在处理内存中的对象时存在远程代码执行漏洞，该漏洞源于 Office 对复合标识符（Composite Moniker）对象的错误处理。攻击者可通过构造特制的 Office 文档（如 PPT、DOC 等），通过邮件或网页等方式诱使用户打开恶意文件触发漏洞，成功利用可在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 2007/2010/2013/2016 等多个版本，已被实际在野利用，属于高危漏洞。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 7 月安全更新中发布补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-8570"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-11T21:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:26:35Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 7 月安全更新 (MS17-022)，对应知识库文章 KB3213654，可通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft 更新目录获取。对于无法立即打补丁的系统，可在 Office 受信任设置中禁用所有 ActiveX 控件，并启用受保护视图以降低通过邮件附件传播的风险。同时建议在邮件网关层面拦截包含 OLE 对象的可疑文档附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99445","https://github.com/ParsingTeam/ppsx-file-generator","https://github.com/rxwx/CVE-2017-8570","https://github.com/tezukanice/Office8570","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-us/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-8570","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-8570","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44263","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-8570.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2017/CVE-2017-8570.json","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/600d27082a152bd7db83f6582fdca9d3c7cbb0d8/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/O97M/Exploit/CVE-2017-8570.yara","https://github.com/SecWiki/office-exploits/blob/54322c15acdd4b837e65061308ad7d3838edba24/CVE-2017-8570/cve-2017-8570_toolkit.py","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/O97M/CVE-2017-8570/Exploit_O97M_CVE-2017-8570_MTB.yar","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/CVE-2017-0199&CVE-2017-8570/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-8570","https://github.com/RedDrip7/APT_Digital_Weapon/blob/cc4cde356dcb4455419d80aedc3bba471249f167/APT23/APT23_hash.md","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/204%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/29976.txt","https://github.com/temesgeny/ppsx-file-generator","https://github.com/SwordSheath/CVE-2017-8570","https://github.com/Drac0nids/CVE-2017-8570","https://github.com/erfze/CVE-2017-8570"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1300","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9791","title":"Apache Struts 2 Struts 1 插件 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Struts 2.1.x 和 2.3.x 的 Struts 1 插件存在远程代码执行漏洞（S2-048），由于对传递给 ActionMessage 的原始消息中的恶意字段值处理不当，导致 OGNL 表达式注入。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送包含恶意 OGNL 表达式的特制字段值，在无需用户交互的情况下远程执行任意代码，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响使用 Struts 1 插件的 Apache Struts 2.1.x 和 2.3.x 版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（严重），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限和用户交互，机密性、完整性、可用性影响均为高。攻击者可通过发送精心构造的 HTTP 请求触发 OGNL 表达式注入，执行任意系统命令。Apache Struts 官方已发布安全公告修复该漏洞，建议升级至 2.3.32 或 2.5.10.1 及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9791"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-10T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:28:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache Struts 到 2.3.34 或更高版本（或 2.5.x 系列），移除已废弃的 Struts 1 插件；如无法立即更新，可临时禁用非必要的 Struts 处理类并配置白名单 URL 模式以阻止恶意字段；同时监控关键服务日志以发现异常行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://struts.apache.org/docs/s2-048.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/alert-cve-2017-9805-3889403.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99484","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038838","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20180706-0002/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42324/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44643/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-9791","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42324","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9791.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-9791.md","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2017-9791.md","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2017-9791/CVE-2017-9791.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/467e8414b7cae9064886839b1c4a1f4c155804ed/2017/CVE-2017-9791.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/b859fc75b332184195f1952ddeea761c6913ce9b/2017/CVE-2017-9791.json","https://github.com/SecWiki/CMS-Hunter/blob/5ad0da9524b385045e7a4a627d2bb52906badfc5/Struts/S2-048(CVE-2017-9791)/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2017/9xxx/CVE-2017-9791.json","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Apache Struts/（CVE-2017-9791）s2-048.md","https://github.com/BaizeSec/bylibrary/blob/dee1fbaa831df860c6905f80de8700211ba63098/docs/漏洞库/06-中间件框架漏洞/Struts2/S2-048(CVE-2017-9791)/README.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web安全/Apache Struts/（CVE-2017-9791）s2-048.md","https://github.com/dragoneeg/Struts2-048","https://github.com/gh0st27/Struts2Scanner","https://github.com/IanSmith123/s2-048","https://github.com/xfer0/CVE-2017-9791"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-1300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-1300.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0020","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11107","title":"phpLDAPadmin entry_chooser.php 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"phpLDAPadmin 1.2.3 及更低版本在 htdocs/entry_chooser.php 文件中存在跨站脚本攻击漏洞。攻击者可通过向表单的 form、element、rdn 或 container 参数提交恶意 payloads 注入未经验证的 JavaScript 代码，导致受害者浏览器执行这些脚本。当受害者访问包含恶意载荷的页面时，攻击者可能窃取会话 Cookie、执行账户操作或收集敏感用户信息。该漏洞影响所有运行 phpLDAPadmin <=1.2.3 的系统，攻击者无需认证即可发起攻击，但需要诱使受害者打开包含恶意 JavaScript 的页面。由于漏洞仅影响浏览器执行用户输入的脚本，因此主要集中在低风险范围，但其潜在危害不可小觑。phpLDAPadmin 1.2.4 及以上版本已修复此漏洞，建议立即更新至最新版本以确保安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11107"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-08T12:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:01:13Z","remediation":"建议升级至 phpLDAPadmin GitHub 最新开发版（含 PR #50 修复），或手动修补 htdocs/entry_chooser.php 对 form/element/rdn/container 参数进行 htmlspecialchars 转义。若无法升级，可通过 Web 应用防火墙拦截包含 <script> 等 XSS 特征的参数值，或在 Web 服务器配置 CSP 策略限制内联脚本执行，临时限制 phpLDAPadmin 仅允许受信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/phpldapadmin/+bug/1701731","https://github.com/leenooks/phpLDAPadmin/issues/50","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/10/msg00023.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11107.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-11107.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11107.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11107.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-11107","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2017/UBUNTU-CVE-2017-11107.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/phpldapadmin_project/phpldapadmin/CVE-2017-11107.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-11107.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2e2ab4687e3840d3ae537224ca3dbe9e3c1067/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-563x-7v47-fh3j/GHSA-563x-7v47-fh3j.json","https://github.com/mssalvatore/ubuntu-cve-tracker-mirror/blob/393245887b9fdc3ecd3096a44e0373d9fb7038a6/retired/CVE-2017-11107","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2017-11107.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0019","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-10974","title":"Yaws Web服务器 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Yaws 1.91 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过向 8080 端口发送包含 /%5C../ 的特制 HTTP 请求绕过路径遍历防护机制，实现未经身份认证的远程文件泄露。该漏洞源于 Yaws Web 服务器对 URL 编码反斜杠（%5C）处理不当，导致路径规范化检查被绕过，攻击者可读取服务器上 Web 根目录之外的任意文件。攻击条件为：目标运行 Yaws 1.91 版本且 8080 端口开放，无需身份认证即可远程利用。攻击者可通过发送类似 GET /%5C../etc/passwd HTTP/1.1 的请求读取敏感系统文件，CVSS 3.0 评分 7.5（HIGH），影响范围为运行 Yaws 1.91 版本的所有服务器。官方已发布修复版本，建议升级至最新版本修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-10974"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-07-07T11:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:01:01Z","remediation":"建议升级 Yaws 至 1.92 或更高版本（官方已修复目录遍历漏洞），可从官网 http://yaws.hyber.org/download/ 下载最新版本并替换原安装目录。若暂无法升级，可在 Yaws 配置文件 yaws.conf 中添加 `exclude_paths = [\"/..\", \"/\\\\..\"]` 规则限制路径遍历，或在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加 `location ~ /\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.\\\\./ { deny all; }` 规则拦截包含 `/\\\\../` 的请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://hyp3rlinx.altervista.org/advisories/YAWS-WEB-SERVER-v1.91-UNAUTHENTICATED-REMOTE-FILE-DISCLOSURE.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99515","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42303/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42303","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-10974.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-10974.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-10974.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2017-10974.js","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2017-10974","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/2017/CVE-2017-10974.json","https://github.com/mscandev/mscan/blob/cb7ba038f76e6e0cf8ffa6ab00db702265d3191c/web/nuclei-templates/cves/2017/CVE-2017-10974.yaml","https://github.com/daffainfo/cvelist/blob/ace4b9e1c9a2c89e72ec789670d27670e4b04242/cves/2017/10xxx/CVE-2017-10974.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/20/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/ahisec/Lots-of-POC/blob/51ed84ccc21e97e5e12563150992e03f9de384cd/nuclei/yaws/yaws/CVE-2017-10974.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2017-10974-2861.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1209","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9248","title":"Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 加密密钥泄露致远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX（R2 2017 SP1之前版本）及Sitefinity（10.0.6412.0之前版本）中的Telerik.Web.UI.dll未正确保护DialogParametersEncryptionKey和MachineKey，导致加密机制被绕过。远程未认证攻击者可利用此漏洞泄露MachineKey，进而实现任意文件上传与下载、跨站脚本攻击（XSS）以及ASP.NET ViewState反序列化攻击。该漏洞无需用户交互即可远程利用，影响范围广泛，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9248"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-07-03T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:27:44Z","remediation":"升级 Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 至 R2 2017 SP1 及以上版本，或升级 Sitefinity 至 10.0.6412.0 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 web.config 中重新生成并设置 MachineKey 和 DialogParametersEncryptionKey，同时限制对 Telerik.Web.UI.DialogHandler.ashx 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99965","http://www.telerik.com/blogs/security-alert-for-telerik-ui-for-asp.net-ajax-and-progress-sitefinity","http://www.telerik.com/support/kb/aspnet-ajax/details/cryptographic-weakness","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43873/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-9248","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43873","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-9248.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2017/9xxx/CVE-2017-9248.json","https://github.com/PortSwigger/BChecks/blob/7117c5ff8d1d47ca6282020a243b4d3026480ad5/vulnerabilities-CVEd/CVE-2017-9248_TelerikUI_Encryption_Keys_Disclosure.bcheck","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b55cbd6817c4f7c7c0ef55106259948a3caf7541/data/2017/CVE-2017-9248-oldboysonnt_dp.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2017-9248.yaml","https://github.com/apachecn/kalilinuxtutorials-zh/blob/b920433fb772feb9c0d49c3ac88abe81b620d04b/docs/telewreck-extension-detect-exploit-cve-2017-9248.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-9248","https://github.com/ProjectZeroDays/Project-Red-Sword/blob/dc89b2d92d87d20d63b1ffff0467fe0f84b4afe6/payloads/CVE%20Exploits/Telerik%20CVE-2017-9248.py","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-9248/README.md","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/241%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/bao7uo/dp_crypto","https://github.com/capt-meelo/Telewreck","https://github.com/blacklanternsecurity/dp_cryptomg","https://github.com/0xsharz/telerik-scanner-cve-2017-9248","https://github.com/ictnamanh/CVE-2017-9248"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-1209.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1309","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9841","title":"PHPUnit PHPUnit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHPUnit 框架核心组件 eval-stdin.php 存在远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2017-9841），该文件包含 eval('?>'.file_get_contents('php://input')) 代码，攻击者可通过向暴露在 Web 目录下的 /vendor/phpunit/phpunit/src/Util/PHP/eval-stdin.php 路径发送以 \"<?php \" 开头的 HTTP POST 数据，直接执行任意 PHP 代码。受影响版本为 PHPUnit 4.8.19-4.8.27 及 5.0.10-5.6.2，攻击条件为：远程无需认证、目标服务器 vendor 目录对外可访问。漏洞利用门槛极低，攻击者可直接获取服务器 Shell 权限，CVSS 9.8 严重级别。受影响产品包括使用 Composer 安装 PHPUnit 且未正确配置 Web 服务器屏蔽 vendor 目录的 PHP 项目（如 Laravel、PrestaShop 等框架及其扩展模块）。修复建议：立即升级至 PHPUnit 4.8.28 或 5.6.3 及以上版本，或通过 Web 服务器配置禁止访问 /vendor 目录，并执行 composer update --no-dev 移除开发依赖。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9841"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-06-27T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 PHPUnit 至 4.8.28 或 5.6.3 及以上版本（composer update phpunit/phpunit）。若无法立即升级，请立即删除或重命名 vendor/phpunit/phpunit/src/Util/PHP/eval-stdin.php 文件，或在 Web 服务器配置中禁止访问 /vendor 目录（如 Nginx: location ~ /vendor/ { deny all; }）。同时建议执行 composer update --no-dev 移除开发依赖，并限制 Web 根目录不暴露 vendor 目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://web.archive.org/web/20170701212357/http://phpunit.vulnbusters.com/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101798","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039812","https://github.com/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/commit/284a69fb88a2d0845d23f42974a583d8f59bf5a5","https://github.com/sebastianbergmann/phpunit/pull/1956","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201711-15","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2021.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-9841","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50702","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9841.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-9841.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/2911be3264007af9623a080cb675cf4852c504f7/2017/CVE-2017-9841.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/phpunit/CVE-2017-9841.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-9841/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-9841.py","https://github.com/crowdsecurity/hub/blob/e67d2deb88ea3c00b8f9a48480a5d89e70e7bf7e/scenarios/crowdsecurity/CVE-2017-9841.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9841.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/by-cve/CVE-2017-9841.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/2017/CVE-2017-9841-joelindra_Argus.md","https://github.com/CLincat/vulcat/blob/4ac98801f331920dd8c0840b8332164176edcab8/payloads/phpUint/phpunit-cve-2017-9841-rce.py","https://github.com/friends-of-presta/security-advisories/blob/b23475f783e7158456af0c544576ca7204ec8546/_posts/2020-01-07-phpunit-CVE-2017-9841.md","https://github.com/RandomRobbieBF/phpunit-brute","https://github.com/incogbyte/laravel-phpunit-rce-masscaner","https://github.com/Chocapikk/CVE-2017-9841","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2017-9841-EXPLOIT","https://github.com/ludy-dev/PHPUnit_eval-stdin_RCE"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-1309.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-1309.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0134","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9833","title":"Boa Web Server 0.94.14rc21 任意文件访问漏洞","description":"Boa Webserver 0.94.14rc21 版本中的 /cgi-bin/wapopen 程序存在路径遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过 GET 请求向 FILECAMERA 变量注入 \"../..\" 路径遍历序列，以 root 权限读取服务器任意文件。该漏洞实为系统集成商问题（如特定摄像头设备），Boa 核心代码本身不包含 wapopen 程序及 FILECAMERA 变量处理代码。CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限与用户交互，机密性影响高。攻击者可远程无需认证即可读取敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd、配置文件等），导致敏感信息泄露。ExploitDB (42290) 及多个 Nuclei 模板已公开 PoC 验证脚本。受影响设备为集成了易受攻击 wapopen CGI 程序的嵌入式设备（如特定 IP 摄像头）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9833"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-06-24T02:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级受影响设备（摄像头/IoT设备）固件至厂商发布的最新版本，修复Boa Webserver 0.94.14rc21中/cgi-bin/wapopen的FILECAMERA参数路径遍历漏洞。若厂商未发布补丁，立即在Web服务器层面禁用/cgi-bin/wapopen CGI脚本，或在Web应用防火墙配置规则拦截包含\"../\"路径遍历载荷的FILECAMERA参数请求，同时限制CGI目录访问权限仅允许必要IP访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://pastebin.com/raw/rt7LJvyF","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42290/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42290","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9833.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-9833.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ae7cbf60471587bdea4445c1578df6c016019acf/2017/CVE-2017-9833.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9833.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2017-9833.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-9833-3111.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-9833-3110.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Boa Webserver/CVE-2017-9833.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2017-9833.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/be9cbbdcace5bb1f0274d67feb2141e8b491875d/plugins/boa/boa/CVE-2017-9833.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2017/9xxx/CVE-2017-9833.json","https://github.com/anldori/CVE-2017-9833"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0134.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1200","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-8543","title":"Microsoft Windows Search 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Search 服务在处理内存对象时存在远程代码执行漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 SMB 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用后可完全控制受影响的系统，实现安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户等操作。该漏洞影响范围广泛，涵盖 Windows XP 至 Windows Server 2016 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 6 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-8543"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-06-15T01:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:26:33Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 6 月安全更新：Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4022717，Windows 10/Server 2016 安装 KB4022726 或 KB4022715，Windows 7/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4022719。如无法打补丁，可在防火墙阻止入站 SMB 流量（TCP 445/139）并禁用 Windows Search 服务（WSearch）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98824","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038667","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-8543","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-8543","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-8543.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2017/CVE-2017-8543.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-8543","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c21137571cced5c6655bc31f22872abfb39df64b/2017/8xxx/CVE-2017-8543.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-8543.txt","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2017/database/CVE-2017-8543/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-8543/poc.py","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-8543.md","https://github.com/783cc003ed/catalogue01/blob/dbe5c25acbf77955364002252fa305684a634652/2017/digest-2017-06.md","https://github.com/americanhanko/windows-security-cve-2017-8543"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1168","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-8464","title":"Microsoft Windows LNK 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Shell 在处理 .LNK 快捷方式文件图标显示时存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可将特制的恶意 .LNK 文件放置在 USB 驱动器或网络共享中，当用户通过 Windows 资源管理器或任何解析快捷方式图标的应用程序浏览该文件时，系统自动解析图标触发漏洞，导致攻击者在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Windows 10（含 1511/1607/1703 版本）、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows Server 2012/R2 及 Windows RT 8.1 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。该漏洞在安全社区中被称为\"震网三代\"，已被实际用于定向攻击活动，用户仅需通过 USB 设备或网络共享浏览恶意目录即可触发，无需额外交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-8464"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-06-15T01:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:26:24Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 6 月安全更新（MS17-010 同期月度更新），该更新已修复 Windows Shell 对 .LNK 文件图标解析时的远程代码执行漏洞。受影响系统包括 Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows 10（1511/1607/1703）、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows Server 2012/R2 及 Windows RT 8.1，请通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取对应版本补丁。如无法立即打补丁，建议禁用 USB 自动播放功能，并在组策略中设置\"关闭自动播放\"为\"已启用\"，同时限制用户对不受信任的 USB 设备和网络共享的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98818","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038671","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-8464","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42382/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42429/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-8464","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42382","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-8464.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2017/CVE-2017-8464.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2017-8464/README.md","https://github.com/nixawk/labs/blob/ce800ddc00a8bbf716afe754a1e81e58570b8c50/CVE-2017-8464/exploit_CVE-2017-8464.py","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2017-8464.md","https://github.com/KINGSABRI/CVE-in-Ruby/blob/761ff3bc2da6999fc193fece83257a03ef25c7af/CVE-2017-8464/cve-2017-8464_exploit.rb","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2017-8464/cve_2017_8464_lnk_rce.rb","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-8464","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c21137571cced5c6655bc31f22872abfb39df64b/2017/8xxx/CVE-2017-8464.json","https://github.com/wonderkun/crawler/blob/281e1d1564e073bd4c1322f63767c0f4fbfcf5eb/www.anquanke.com/CVE-2017-8464_%E9%9C%87%E7%BD%91%E4%B8%89%E4%BB%A3%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9Ewindbg%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95.md","https://github.com/3gstudent/CVE-2017-8464-EXP","https://github.com/doudouhala/CVE-2017-8464-exp-generator","https://github.com/TrG-1999/DetectPacket-CVE-2017-8464","https://github.com/Elm0D/CVE-2017-8464","https://github.com/xssfile/CVE-2017-8464-EXP"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0132","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9416","title":"Odoo Odoo 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Odoo 的 `tools.file_open` 函数存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22），远程认证攻击者可通过构造包含 `../` 等遍历序列的特殊文件路径参数，绕过路径限制访问服务器上的任意本地文件（如配置文件、数据库凭证等）。该漏洞影响 Odoo 8.0、9.0 和 10.0 版本，攻击者仅需拥有低权限账号即可利用，无需任何用户交互。由于 Odoo 服务通常以较高权限运行，攻击者可读取系统敏感文件导致信息泄露。CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9416"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-06-04T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:28:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 Odoo 至修复版本：8.0 升级至 commit d18d606a 以上，9.0 升级至 98f5f1b8 以上，10.0 升级至 76cd8d25 以上，或从 https://www.odoo.com/page/download 下载安装最新版。如无法升级，可在文件系统层面限制 Odoo 运行用户对敏感文件的读取权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/odoo/odoo/issues/17394","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9416.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9416.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-9416.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2017/9xxx/CVE-2017-9416.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/be9cbbdcace5bb1f0274d67feb2141e8b491875d/plugins/odoo/odoo/CVE-2017-9416.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2017-9416.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-9416.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-9416","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-9416.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9416.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-9416.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0132.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0132.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1108","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-7494","title":"Samba 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Samba 服务器软件 3.5.0 至 4.6.4、4.5.10、4.4.14 版本中存在远程代码执行漏洞（SambaCry）。该漏洞源于 SMB 协议处理函数 is_known_pipename() 在加载共享库时未正确验证路径，拥有可写共享目录访问权限的远程攻击者可上传恶意构造的共享库文件，并通过特制 RPC 请求触发服务端加载执行，从而实现远程代码执行。攻击无需身份认证，仅需目标 Samba 服务开放可写共享且启用 smb.conf 中的 ntlm auth 选项。该漏洞影响大量 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。目前已公开 Metasploit 利用模块及独立 Python 利用脚本，建议立即升级至 Samba 4.6.4/4.5.10/4.4.14 及以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-7494"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-05-30T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:24:27Z","remediation":"立即升级 Samba 至 4.6.4、4.5.10 或 4.4.14 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 smb.conf 的 [global] 段中添加 `nt pipe support = no` 禁用命名管道支持作为临时缓解措施，但此操作会影响打印机共享等功能。同时建议在防火墙层面限制 SMB 端口（139/TCP、445/TCP）仅对可信来源开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2017/dsa-3860","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98636","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038552","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:1270","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:1271","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:1272","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:1273","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:1390","https://download.schneider-electric.com/files?p_enDocType=Technical+leaflet&p_File_Name=SEVD-2018-095-01+Security+Notification+Umotion+V1.1.pdf&p_Doc_Ref=SEVD-2018-095-01","https://h20566.www2.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docLocale=en_US&docId=emr_na-hpesbns03755en_us","https://h20566.www2.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docLocale=en_US&docId=emr_na-hpesbux03759en_us","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201805-07","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20170524-0001/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42060/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42084/","https://www.samba.org/samba/security/CVE-2017-7494.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-7494","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42084","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-7494.md","https://github.com/SecWiki/linux-kernel-exploits/blob/2d2152cf9a58f668da720d12423e5a8a424eca3a/2017/CVE-2017-7494/README.md","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2017-7494.md","https://github.com/Waffles-2/SambaCry/blob/09b0d47a386480e87bbe2423b4d5a0d949712df0/CVE-2017-7494.nse","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/d9ea0d68999da7e2b3bfae779b24e1be083e8518/data/2017/CVE-2017-7494-brianwrf_SambaHunter.md","https://github.com/LyleMi/Learn-Web-Hacking/blob/7a42e3252fdcae87663434b1fd54ec89d671bfbe/source/cloud/docker/ref.rst","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/486c990d1562f3a9f79527b0aa854bf4fa7784c7/scripts/script.db","https://github.com/fortra/impacket/blob/df6a18adcaf7a11138a25d70f94cbe15824cf3b1/ChangeLog.md","https://github.com/TuuuNya/nmap_scripts/blob/401bcd4b2c79fee88a0dd1443ce3fe13fb896c31/smb-vuln-cve-2017-7494.nse","https://github.com/Al1ex/LinuxEelvation/blob/69cee23442f742c50809f75803b4ebca959f9927/CVE-2017-7494/42060.py","https://github.com/opsxcq/exploit-CVE-2017-7494","https://github.com/joxeankoret/CVE-2017-7494","https://github.com/betab0t/cve-2017-7494","https://github.com/Waffles-2/SambaCry","https://github.com/brianwrf/SambaHunter"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0131","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9288","title":"WordPress Raygun4WP 插件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Raygun4WP 是 WordPress 的一个错误日志追踪插件，其 1.8.0 版本中的 sendtesterror.php 文件存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于对 backurl 参数缺乏充分的输入过滤与输出编码，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 URL 链接，诱使用户点击后，在用户浏览器中执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接）。该漏洞影响 Raygun4WP 1.8.0 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9288"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-29T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:27:49Z","remediation":"立即将 Raygun4WP 插件升级至 1.8.3 或更高版本（1.8.3 版本已移除 sendtesterror.php 中危险的 backurl 参数，改用硬编码返回链接）。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，对 backurl 参数进行过滤，拦截 <script> 等危险载荷；同时在 WordPress 管理员后台禁用「发送测试错误」功能作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://jgj212.blogspot.kr/2017/05/a-reflected-xss-vulnerability-in.html","https://github.com/MindscapeHQ/raygun4wordpress/issues/16","https://github.com/MindscapeHQ/raygun4wordpress/pull/17","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8836","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9288.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-9288.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9288.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-9288.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-9288-3086.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-9288-3084.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2017-9288.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2017-9288.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2017-9288.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2017/9xxx/CVE-2017-9288.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-18531.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1198","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-8540","title":"Microsoft Malware Protection Engine 远程执行代码漏洞","description":"Microsoft 恶意软件保护引擎（MsMpEng）在处理特制文件时存在内存破坏漏洞。由于引擎的垃圾回收（GC）机制存在设计缺陷，导致释放后重用（Use-After-Free），远程攻击者可通过构造恶意文件并诱导用户打开或由 Exchange Server 自动扫描触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10、Windows Server 2008/2012/2016 及 Exchange Server 2013/2016 等多个平台，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已于 2017 年 5 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-8540"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-05-26T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:26:32Z","remediation":"立即确保 Microsoft 恶意软件保护引擎 (mpengine.dll) 升级至 1.1.13704.0 或更高版本。该更新通过 Windows Update/Microsoft Update 自动推送，通常 48 小时内完成安装；也可在受影响产品中手动执行\"检查更新\"强制触发。对于企业环境，应通过 WSUS/Configuration Manager 审批并部署引擎更新，确保所有终端（包括 Windows Defender、System Center Endpoint Protection、Exchange Server 2013/2016 等）均运行最新引擎版本。临时缓解措施：在无法立即更新的系统上禁用实时保护中的脚本扫描功能，但会降低防护能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98703","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038571","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-8540","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42088/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-8540","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42088","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-8540.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/87c3c6939cf4753db954551441a9567082e88cc1/cves/2017/8xxx/CVE-2017-8540.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c21137571cced5c6655bc31f22872abfb39df64b/2017/8xxx/CVE-2017-8540.json","https://github.com/SionThanatos/windows-vuln-sok/blob/c787317758a44da3b624e7b8f4cb5b78f5430de6/CVEs/CVE-2017-8540[Defender][Use%20After%20Free][Elevation%20of%20Privilege]/CVE-2017-8540_42450283.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-8540.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/c9912f011045fb46c541c894a8ebf29180b9a4d7/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-8540.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-342q-x494-83vw/GHSA-342q-x494-83vw.json","https://github.com/swimlane/soc-faker/blob/361c4ae88956878fbd8aaf5975044328556dfecd/socfaker/data/alert_names.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-8540.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-1198.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1009","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6862","title":"Netgear WNR2000系列路由器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NETGEAR WNR2000 系列路由器（含 WNR2000v3 1.1.2.14 之前、WNR2000v4 1.0.0.66 之前、WNR2000v5 1.0.0.42 之前固件）管理 Web 应用存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-120，厂商编号 PSV-2016-0261）。攻击者无需身份认证，可通过网络向管理接口提交特制参数触发溢出，实现认证绕过并执行任意代码，进而完全控制设备。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，影响上述未及时升级固件的家用路由设备。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6862"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-05-26T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:23:13Z","remediation":"请将 NETGEAR WNR2000v3 固件升级至 1.1.2.14 或更高版本，WNR2000v4 升级至 1.0.0.66 或更高版本，WNR2000v5 升级至 1.0.0.42 或更高版本；可在管理界面“高级 > 管理 > 固件更新”中手动上传官方固件完成升级。若暂时无法升级，应关闭远程管理（WAN 侧管理）、将管理界面仅限内网访问，并在防火墙上限制对路由器 Web 管理端口的入站访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98740","https://kb.netgear.com/000038542/Security-Advisory-for-Unauthenticated-Remote-Code-Execution-on-Some-Routers-PSV-2016-0261","https://www.on-x.com/sites/default/files/on-x_-_security_advisory_-_netgear_wnr2000v5_-_cve-2017-6862.pdf","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-6862","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6862.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6862.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-6862","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e3454357078cf368426374d4a62627b3db36a838/2017/6xxx/CVE-2017-6862.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/N/netgear_wnr2000_CVE-2017-6862.nasl","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-6862/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-6862.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-6862.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-xjjj-92c2-q84f/GHSA-xjjj-92c2-q84f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1009.toml"}]